/* MARK: Android emulator guide */
"android.emulator.title" = "Android Emulator Setup Guide";
"android.emulator.intro" = "Install the ProxyMaxx certificate as a system CA and point the emulator's proxy here, so HTTPS traffic can be decrypted. On a Google APIs image this uses `adb root`. Android Studio Google Play AVDs ship a production-signed `adbd`, so there `adb root` is unavailable and the bundled, consent-based Magisk route is offered instead — Magisk compatibility has been tested on API 30-37.";
